OL,3,AThe job interview question you don't
OL,4,Ahave to answer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrepare all you like, but there is
OL,7,Foften still one job interview question
OL,8,Fthat leaves you feeling uncomfortable.
OL,10,FWhile employers in the UK are within
OL,11,Ftheir rights to ask you how much you
OL,12,Fget paid in your current role,
OL,13,Fapplicants are not obliged to tell
OL,14,Fthem.
OL,16,FRecruiters have been encouraged to stop
OL,17,Fposing questions about salary history
OL,18,Fand, in the EU, new rules will prevent
OL,19,Fthem doing so.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
